      "statement": "Environments are exposed when an Issuer or ClusterIssuer uses an ACME DNS-01 solver backed by AWS Route53 and Route53 returns a not-found error while cert-manager deletes a DNS record at runtime. In that case cert-manager 1.18.0 now detects the not-found error correctly."
