    "reason": "[ev-23e99dfde8d0] limits the fix to AWS Route53 not-found errors raised while DNS records are being deleted. Using Route53 for DNS-01 (an Issuer or ClusterIssuer with a route53 solver) is needed for exposure, but it is not enough. The changed behaviour only shows up when Route53 actually returns a not-found error during deletion, and no configuration records that. So the proposed config-only condition is too broad, and it needs an undecidable runtime operand added to it.",
